# Every entry the frontend build's Rust exports (design item D12), one per line, tab-separated: its name, its C
# parameters, and the test that exercises it. The program's main calls it, and it reports a failure in its buffer and
# returns false, never exiting and never unwinding into C.

doltgres_fsck	const char *datadir, DgLine line, DgKept kept	test/t/025_checkversioned.pl: a clean cluster exits 0
